    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108920" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποπέμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send under, to,</i> or <i>into,</i> c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γᾶς ὑποπεμπομένα σκότον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					209
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>send secretly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.4.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1352a3
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				1.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>send as a spy, send in a false character,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.4.22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
			</span></i> l.c., and v. foreg.</div>
